<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 51-1 V NOTTINGHAMSHIRE (239) AT CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 51-1 V NOTTINGHAMSHIRE (239) AT CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>NOTTINGHAM, England 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were 51</p>
<p>for one in reply to Nottinghamshire's first innings score of 239</p>
<p>at the close on the second day of their three-day match at Trent</p>
<p>Bridge on Thursday.</p>
</text>
